= About Polish Red Autumn

This is a playable modern Polish total conversion for
*Social Democracy: An Alternate History*.

The campaign runs from October 2019 to July 2023. Its two-deck hand, factional
advisor bureau, all-party electorate model and rival-party AI feed the
presidential election, pandemic, budgets, border, war, inflation and
opposition-realignment crises.

A separate October–December 2023 formation route adapts the inherited election
chart, results, coalition and cabinet flow to Polish confidence votes and
ministry bargaining.

